WEBVTT

00:08:59.240 --> 00:09:00.856
People are coming in from Queens,

00:09:00.880 --> 00:09:03.776
transferring from the E train
to the 6 train.

00:09:03.800 --> 00:09:06.896
And they're going up
these giant escalators

00:09:06.920 --> 00:09:08.458
on their way to their jobs.

00:09:10.840 --> 00:09:11.990
[Rob wants]

00:09:16.235 --> 00:09:17.647
[to give you]

00:09:20.175 --> 00:09:21.325
(Laughter)

00:09:21.349 --> 00:09:22.602
[a high five!]

00:09:22.626 --> 00:09:25.070
(Laughter)

00:09:25.094 --> 00:09:26.343
[Get ready!]

00:09:26.367 --> 00:09:33.336
(Laughter)